{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1095311-kinain-to-kithain","id":1095311,"title":"Kinain to Kithain?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-21T18:19:24-07:00","id":1095311,"title":"Kinain to Kithain?","content":"One game I've always wanted to play but never had the opportunity to is one where a Kinain was elevated to Kithain by having her Fairy blood and soul somehow enhanced and purified. If we are going the crossover route then Suzuka, the Totem from the Stargazer book that embodies exalted bloodlines and increases Pure Breed by 1 can probably do it in exchange for some uber quest to enhance her standing in the spirit courts. The Totem Dana might know a way. Can anyone else think of how a Kinain can be so enhanced?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T19:29:20-07:00","id":1095330,"title":"","content":"Some lost trasure in the depths of the dreaming maybe? some RELLY crazy use of Naming.... dark rituals of sacrifice, maybe using the immortal eyes thats jsut off the top of my head","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T23:17:15-07:00","id":1095381,"title":"","content":"group Unleashings?<br /> <br /> I would simple have Tuatha take the Kinain to Arcadia and when the Kinain returns she is a full on Changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T23:27:56-07:00","id":1095384,"title":"","content":"I'd tie it to a Glimmering. These extreme momments when the gates of Arcadia spring open these are the Zenith of the Dreaming when New possibilities manifest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T05:06:49-07:00","id":1095447,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1095311-kinain-to-kithain?p=1095330#post1095330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some lost trasure in the depths of the dreaming maybe? some RELLY crazy use of Naming.... dark rituals of sacrifice, maybe using the immortal eyes thats jsut off the top of my head</div> </div> </div> </div>Immortal Eyes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T06:03:11-07:00","id":1095456,"title":"","content":"My understanding of the metaphysics of Changeling is that if you've undergone the Changeling Way, then your soul merges with a human soul before birth (remaining dormant until the Chrysalis), so you become a hybrid of your fae and human halves, with your fae half reincarnating, taking its memories, but being a different person each time due to the human half. Or, you do what the Arcadian sidhe do, and displace the human soul entirely. <br /> <br /> So a kinain might make a good candidate for a fae soul (either to merge with or displace) because of their fae affinity, but becoming kithain would mean acquiring a fae soul somehow. This probably <i>is</i> what happened to a lot of kinain when the Arcadian sidhe returned. Under unusual circumstances, I guess a fae soul could merge with a kinain's soul per the Changeling Way, but I imagine it would require interesting circumstances for this to to happen later in life. <br /> <br /> The idea that purifying bloodlines could bring a kinain closer to becoming a true fae is interesting, but that would create a new fae soul, rather than a kithain soul? And then how would that fae soul survive? I suppose theoretically it could become like the Arcadian sidhe - a fae soul in a flesh house - just without displacing anything because it would be a kinain-turned-fae soul in there instead. Certainly a fascinating question and a possible start for a Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T00:17:07-07:00","id":1095784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1095311-kinain-to-kithain?p=1095447#post1095447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Immortal Eyes?</div> </div> </div> </div>A trio of Artifacts I believe, one in San Fran, one in Hawaii, and one in Ireland. There are a trio of setting books about them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T06:24:49-07:00","id":1095872,"title":"","content":"four artifacts, the Change stone, Shadow stone Key stone and Way stone. 2 seelie 2 unseelie. the eyes of the sidhe brothers who held open the last arcadian gate in the shattering. sacrificing themselves so others could get 